{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>What\u2019s the core of the game?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Detective Pig</i></strong>, besides the story, there\u2019s also a unique combat mechanic. You\u2019ll dive headfirst into a world of adventure. The goal is to eliminate all enemy pigs while staying unnoticed. The gameplay is in <strong><i>stealth</i></strong> <strong>style</strong>. You\u2019ll need to use foresight to predict outcomes and, at the same time, keep track of every pig in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5cf887dc6dfba4fff564dff4d5dfcbfa.poster.avif?t=1770049649\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5cf887dc6dfba4fff564dff4d5dfcbfa.webm?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/5cf887dc6dfba4fff564dff4d5dfcbfa.mp4?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>What\u2019s in the game?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are 2 modes: <i><strong>Storyline</strong></i> and <i><strong>Battle</strong> Levels for rewards</i>.<br>Before you start playing, there will be a <i>Tutorial</i> that will teach you how to be a real Detective and understand the basics of the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you enjoying the game but suddenly <strong>can't progress further</strong> in the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There's a solution: <strong>Eye Detective</strong>! Simply press <strong>F</strong> to activate this superpower. You'll then see two signs: <strong>&quot;!&quot;</strong> and <strong>&quot;?&quot;</strong> above actionable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;!&quot;</strong> will direct you to progress in the STORYline. While <strong>&quot;?&quot;</strong> will show you an optional action on objects also in the STORYline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This ability also works in Battle levels, but the prompt is only <strong>&quot;?&quot;</strong>. It will show you everything you can interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/4adb91f69252664abebc76b049d15027.poster.avif?t=1770049649\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/4adb91f69252664abebc76b049d15027.webm?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/4adb91f69252664abebc76b049d15027.mp4?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Are there skins? Or a shop?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By completing levels, you\u2019ll earn <i>PigCoins</i> and <i>Event Currency</i>, which can be exchanged for skins in the shop. There are 4 rarity types: <strong><i>Rare</i></strong><i> (1)</i>, <strong><i>Epic</i></strong><i> (2)</i>, <strong><i>Legendary</i></strong><i> (3)</i>, and <strong><i>Event</i></strong><i> (+)</i>.<br>Skins can be obtained not only in the shop but also on game locations simply by picking up weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/69a41c38e91a37efe1804489e519cdf2.poster.avif?t=1770049649\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/69a41c38e91a37efe1804489e519cdf2.webm?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/69a41c38e91a37efe1804489e519cdf2.mp4?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>What\u2019s the story?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a player from the real world who ended up in a universe called <i>Hryunville</i> in the form of a brilliant detective. Your first case brings you to the house of an influential and wealthy family. They entrust you with their most important task: uncovering the mystery of their son\u2019s disappearance and finding him, wherever he may be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>And is there anything else? Huh?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes! Yes! And yes again! The game is full of different references \u2014 from various streamers to developers who participated in creating or testing the game. There\u2019s also a huge amount of interactivity and Easter eggs connected to our very first game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/911253be7d5a435fbeef4e9630ba5887.poster.avif?t=1770049649\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/911253be7d5a435fbeef4e9630ba5887.webm?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/911253be7d5a435fbeef4e9630ba5887.mp4?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Who is this game for?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Detective Pig</i></strong>\u00a0is a game for the whole family. It features cute music and cozy graphics. There are no swear words or bloody violent scenes. However, there are attacks with different types of cartoon-style weapons. That\u2019s why we recommend the game for players aged 12 and above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/a95ac7d03c0a2995018fd92b43f39064.avif?t=1770049649\" width=708 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/bc028f135b4d78d4b04c588e8090e12b.poster.avif?t=1770049649\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/bc028f135b4d78d4b04c588e8090e12b.webm?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952160/extras/bc028f135b4d78d4b04c588e8090e12b.mp4?t=1770049649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952160?t=1770049649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952160?t=1770049649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.